{"id":"angetan","lemma":"angetan","pos":"adj","rank":1076,"glosses":["be taken with something; have taken a shine","suitable, appropriate, apposite, calculated"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/99/De-angetan.ogg/De-angetan.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wer hat euch das angetan?","en":"Who did that to you?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Was hast du mir angetan?","en":"What did you do to me?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe dir nichts angetan.","en":"I didn't do anything to you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718195","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"nothing"},null]},{"text":"Sie wissen, was sie mir angetan haben.","en":"They know what they have done to me.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Was habt ihr einander angetan?","en":"What did you do to each other?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"Reciprocal pronoun of…"},null]}]}